", "README.md": "# Cosmic Collector\n\nA vibrant neon collection game — collect stars, dodge bombs!\n\n## How to Play\n\n1. Open `index.html` in a browser\n2. Move your mouse or touch to control the player\n3. Collect pink stars for points\n4. Dodge orange bombs — you have 3 lives!\n5. Build combos for bonus points\n6. Difficulty increases every 10 seconds\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — Game structure and UI\n- `styles.css` — Neon-themed styling\n- `game.js` — Complete game logic (no external dependencies)\n- `README.md` — This file\n\n## Features\n\n- Smooth player movement with trail effect\n- Particle effects on collect and hit\n- Combo system with multiplier bonus\n- Progressive difficulty scaling\n- Screen shake feedback\n- Web Audio synthesized sound effects\n- High score persistence via localStorage\n- Responsive design for desktop and mobile\n- Animated UI with gradient text and glassmorphism\n"}